  "instructions": [
    "heat the lard in a large tagine or Dutch oven over medium heat.",
    "add the onion and garlic and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "add the anchovies, fish sauce, and soy sauce, and stir to combine.",
    "add the coconut milk and bring the mixture to a simmer.",
    "add the egg rolls and cook until heated through, about 3-4 minutes.",
    "add the fennel seeds, coriander seeds, and chili peppers (if using) and stir to combine.",
    "reduce heat to low and simmer, covered, for 10-15 minutes.",
    "season with salt to taste.",
    "serve hot with steamed rice and fresh vegetables."
